<div class="eyebrow">Initiatives</div><h1 class="" data-bn="পাঁচটি ল্যাব, প্রতিটির নির্দিষ্ট লক্ষ্য।">Five labs. Each with a <em>finish line</em>.</h1><p class="lead">Our initiatives are where the method runs every day: a place, a team and a flagship project you can follow stage by stage.</p>
