<div><p>Speech, text and vision models for Bangla, built on open data and evaluated for fairness.</p><p class="proj"><b>Flagship project</b> Voice assistant for union parishad services <span class="sample">Sample</span></p><ol class="rail sm" aria-label="Stage: Develop (2 of 5)"><li class="on"><span>Discover</span></li><li class="cur"><span>Develop</span></li><li class=""><span>Validate</span></li><li class=""><span>Brief</span></li><li class=""><span>Implement</span></li></ol></div><div class="st"><span class="sdgt sdgc-9" title="SDG 9: Industry & Innovation">9</span><span class="sdgt sdgc-16" title="SDG 16: Strong Institutions">16</span></div></article><article class="irow rv"><span class="n">04</span><div><h3 data-bn="হার্ডওয়্যার ল্যাব"><a class="irow-a" href="{{ route('initiatives.hardware-lab') }}">Hardware Lab</a></h3><p class="kicker">Hardware & Engineering</p></div>
