<div><p>An executive AI layer on top of a business ERP: ask in Bangla, English or Banglish, by voice or text, and get the numbers, the reason and the recommended action.</p><p class="proj"><b>Flagship project</b> EON: one brain, many decision layers for business <span class="sample">Sample</span></p><ol class="rail sm" aria-label="Stage: Validate (3 of 5)"><li class="on"><span>Discover</span></li><li class="on"><span>Develop</span></li><li class="cur"><span>Validate</span></li><li class=""><span>Brief</span></li><li class=""><span>Implement</span></li></ol></div><div class="st"><span class="sdgt sdgc-8" title="SDG 8: Decent Work">8</span><span class="sdgt sdgc-9" title="SDG 9: Industry & Innovation">9</span></div></article></div><p class="note">Labs are launching through 2027. Flagship projects shown are sample entries from the Idea Ledger.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec navy"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">How a lab runs</div><h2 class="" data-bn="এক পদ্ধতি, পাঁচ ল্যাব।">One method, five labs.</h2><div class="method"><div class="rv"><span class="k">01</span><h3>Discover</h3><span class="bn">অনুসন্ধান</span><p>We scout campuses, open calls and the Idea Portal for people already solving real problems.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">02</span><h3>Develop</h3><span class="bn">উন্নয়ন</span><p>Mentors, labs and sprints turn a raw idea into a working prototype with a clear owner.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">03</span><h3>Validate</h3><span class="bn">যাচাই</span><p>Field tests, peer review and data show whether it works, for whom and at what cost.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">04</span><h3>Brief</h3><span class="bn">ব্রিফ</span><p>We write policy-grade briefs and put the evidence in front of the people who decide.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">05</span><h3>Implement</h3><span class="bn">বাস্তবায়ন</span><p>Partners pilot, adopt and scale. The innovator keeps the credit and a fair stake.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cta rv"><div class="cta-in"><div class="eyebrow">Next step</div><h2 class="" data-bn="ল্যাব চ্যালেঞ্জ আয়োজন করুন।">Host a lab challenge.</h2><p>Bring a problem your organisation needs solved. We will run it through a lab with young innovators.</p></div><div class="btns"><a class="btn light" href="{{ route('partners') }}">Open the briefing room →</a></div></div></div></section>
